{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "gymgest-api-v1",
		"name": "GymGest API v1",
		"description": "Colección completa de endpoints para GymGest API.\n\n**Configuración:**\n1. Importar esta colección en Postman\n2. Crear un Environment con las variables definidas abajo\n3. Ejecutar \"Register (Trainer)\" o \"Login (Trainer)\" para obtener token\n4. Los tokens e IDs se guardan automáticamente en variables\n\n**Variables de entorno necesarias:**\n- base_url: http://localhost:8000/api/v1\n- trainer_email\n- trainer_password\n- trainer_token (auto)\n- trainer_id (auto)\n- student_email\n- student_password\n- student_token (auto)\n- student_id (auto)\n- gym_id (auto)\n- routine_id (auto)\n- assignment_id (auto)\n- session_id (auto)\n- exercise_id (auto)",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{trainer_token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "🔐 Auth",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Register (Trainer)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
									"});",
									"",
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (jsonData.token) {",
									"        pm.environment.set(\"trainer_token\", jsonData.token);",
									"        console.log(\"✅ Trainer token guardado\");",
									"    }",
									"    if (jsonData.user && jsonData.user.id) {",
									"        pm.environment.set(\"trainer_id\", jsonData.user.id);",
									"        console.log(\"✅ Trainer ID guardado:\", jsonData.user.id);",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Entrenador\",\n    \"last_name\": \"Test\",\n    \"email\": \"{{trainer_email}}\",\n    \"password\": \"{{trainer_password}}\",\n    \"password_confirmation\": \"{{trainer_password}}\",\n    \"role\": \"trainer\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/register",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"auth",
								"register"
							]
						},
						"description": "Registrar un nuevo entrenador.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- name: string (requerido)\n- last_name: string (requerido)\n- email: string (requerido, único)\n- password: string (requerido, mínimo 6 caracteres)\n- password_confirmation: string (requerido, debe coincidir)\n- role: \"trainer\" (requerido)\n\n**Response 201:**\n```json\n{\n    \"user\": {\n        \"id\": \"uuid\",\n        \"name\": \"Entrenador\",\n        \"last_name\": \"Test\",\n        \"email\": \"trainer@example.com\",\n        \"role\": \"trainer\",\n        \"email_verified_at\": null\n    },\n    \"token\": \"jwt_token_here\"\n}\n```"
					},
					"response": []
				},
